    }
  },
  "categories": {
    "_note": "Pylon category slug -> page label, in page order. NULL category = 'uncategorized'. A slug missing here stops the run (pre-flight) so a new category is labelled on purpose. 'ticket' (added 2026-11-12) is a Pylon category value with no specific type; shown as its own row.",
